OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 61, charged with murder after
OL,4,A'stabbed' woman dies following crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a woman who had suffered "stab
OL,8,Fwounds" died following a crash.
OL,10,FHousing association worker Eleanor
OL,11,FBarnfield, 47, died in hospital after
OL,12,Fpolice were called to the crash in
OL,13,FBridgend on Monday, where they found
OL,14,Fshe had "puncture wounds unrelated to
OL,15,Fthe collision", which the BBC
OL,16,Funderstands were sustained in a
OL,17,Fstabbing.
OL,19,FClifford Foster, 61, from Bridgend, has
OL,20,Fbeen charged with murder and is due to
OL,21,Fappear at Newport Magistrates' Court on
OL,22,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
