OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 61, charged with murder after
OL,4,A'stabbed' woman dies following crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh Ambulance Service (WAS) has
OL,7,Fdenied Barnfield was driving because of
OL,8,Fambulance wait times, saying it was
OL,9,Faware of "misleading rumours"
OL,10,Fcirculating online.
